1885 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 914 0 R
/E (Upgrade only when: \(1\) you have a signed contract or confirmed route requiring more capacity, \(2\) the new vehicle payment is under 20% of your weekly gross, and \(3\) you have 3 months of expenses saved. Example: $180/day route confirmed = $900/week gross. Max vehicle payment: $180/week or $780/month.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1886 0 obj
<<
