2332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 922 0 R
/E (Platforms pay weekly \(Tuesdays typically\). Amazon Flex pays 2 days after block. Direct clients: invoice net-7 or net-14. Know your cash flow timing so you never miss a bill.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
2333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 922 0 R
/E (Use Relay, Novo, or a local credit union. $0 monthly fees. All platform deposits and client payments land here. Never deposit business income into personal checking.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
2334 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 922 0 R
/E (Move 25-30% of every deposit into a separate savings account immediately. For $1,000/week gross, that is $250-$300/week. Covers quarterly estimated taxes \(Form 1040-ES due Jan, Apr, Jun, Sep\).)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
2335 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 922 0 R
/E (Fuel: $200-$350/week for full-time drivers. Insurance: $150-$400/month commercial. Maintenance reserve: $0.10-$0.15/mile saved. Pay all from business checking only.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
2336 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 922 0 R
/E (After taxes and expenses are covered, transfer a fixed weekly amount to personal. Example: $1,200 gross - $300 tax - $350 expenses = $550 estimated net profit. That is your real paycheck.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
2337 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 922 0 R
/E (Every Sunday: total miles, total revenue, total expenses, net profit. Takes 10 minutes. Catches problems early. If net drops below $15/hour, something needs to change immediately.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
